      "text": "@Apple @AppleSupport \nContacts on iPhone, even with an upgrade to iOS 26, can only be deleted individually, while batch deletion is only possible by logging into the web version of iCloud. More importantly, the iCloud web contacts management page still doesn't support mobile device access. Can Apple include batch contact deletion for mobile devices in the system update agenda? Even enabling it on the iCloud web version for mobile devices would help."
